nternational Conference on Tafsir and Contemporary Issues\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"block md:hidden object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 40vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatured-conference.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatured-conference.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatured-conference.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatured-conference.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatured-conference.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatured-conference.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatured-conference.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatured-conference.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatured-conference.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatured-conference.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatured-conference.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 w-28 h-28 border-2 border-amber-400 rounded-2xl pointer-events-none z-0 hidden sm:block\"></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-emerald-700\"></span><span class=\"text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">UPCOMING INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE</span></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 leading-snug mb-3\">International Conference on Tafsir and Contemporary Issues</h2><p class=\"text-emerald-800 text-sm sm:text-base font-medium mb-6\">Theme: <!-- -->The Qur&#x27;an and Humanity – Guidance for the Future</p><div class=\"space-y-2 mb-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar w-4 h-4 text-emerald-800 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v3\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 9h18\"></path></svg><span>24–25 December 2026</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-emerald-800 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span>IRITAQ Research Complex, Kerala, India</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-2.5 mb-8 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 shrink-0\"></span><span>Global Scholars and Researchers</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 shrink-0\"></span><span>Innovative Ideas and Perspectives</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 shrink-0\"></span><span>Academic Excellence and Integrity</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 shrink-0\"></span><span>Building International Collaborations</span></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-full transition shadow-xs\" href=\"/conference/tafsir-contemporary-issues-2026\"><span>View Details</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-[#f8f6f0] border-y border-amber-200/50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-emerald-700\"></span><span class=\"text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">OUR ACADEMIC EVENTS</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-3\">Diverse Forums for Knowledge Exchange</h2><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-3xl leading-relaxed\">From major international conferences to intimate seminars, IRITAQ convenes a range of scholarly gatherings designed to advance research and foster collaboration.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-amber-500 font-serif text-lg font-light mb-4 block\">01</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-3\">International Conferences</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Prestigious global conferences that bring together leading scholars, researchers, and institutions to discuss emerging issues and advancements in Qur&#x27;anic scholarship.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-amber-500 font-serif text-lg font-light mb-4 block\">02</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-3\">Seminars</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Regular academic seminars focusing on specialized topics in Qur&#x27;anic Studies and Islamic scholarship, encouraging discussion and intellectual engagement.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-amber-500 font-serif text-lg font-light mb-4 block\">03</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-3\">Workshops</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Practical workshops to enhance research skills, methodologies, academic writing, manuscript studies, digital humanities, and AI applications in research.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-amber-500 font-serif text-lg font-light mb-4 block\">04</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-3\">Colloquiums</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Scholarly colloquiums that promote focused academic dialogue on contemporary and emerging issues related to the Holy Qur&#x27;an.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-amber-500 font-serif text-lg font-light mb-4 block\">05</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-3\">Symposiums</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">National and international symposiums featuring renowned scholars presenting original research and exploring significant developments in the field.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><a href=\"#upcoming-events\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium px-7 py-3 rounded-full transition shadow-xs\"><span>Explore Upcoming Events</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section id=\"upcoming-events\" class=\"py-16 md:py-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-emerald-700\"></span><span class=\"text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">UPCOMING EVENTS</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-3\">Calendar of Forthcoming Gatherings</h2><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl\">Join us at our upcoming conferences, seminars, workshops, and colloquiums.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group\"><div><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-16/10 bg-slate-100 overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"International Conference on Tafsir and Contemporary Issues\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"hidden md:block object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fevent-1.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fevent-1.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fevent-1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fevent-1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fevent-1.jpg&amp;w=828&a